id=dumbdown_plan_unlock
name=DumbDown Plan Unlock
version=v1.0.0
versionCode=1
author=amber
description=Re-enables the DumbDown Launcher's plan-gated features by setting has_subscription=true (and hide_smart_txt/hide_audio_bundle=false) in the app's device_pairing prefs at boot, and null-routes the defunct bundle-flags backend so the flags can't be re-locked. No app code is modified.
